  "description": "Our benchmark Cale trail bike with its multi-butted 4130 steel frame gets RockShox’s Revelation RC 130 suspension fork, offering more control and tuning options. Sram GX Eagle 12 speed drivetrain helps to send you safely through any trail with its 10 - 52T cassette and Sram’s Guide RE four piston calipers provide you with all the braking control you need. A 150 mm dropper post, 800 mm wide Seido handlebar and short stem help to keep you pointed in the right direction for maximum fun and, naturally, it features a multitude of mounting locations should you get that weekend pass. Tan wall 29 x 2.4’’ Maxxis Ardent tyres deliver fast rolling multi-surface grip and complete the stunning look with that burgundy red paint job.",
